#. type: Title #
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:1 docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Anima URI"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:8
msgid ""
"Stable, parseable entity locators for Shell UI (deep links, overlay, "
"clipboard) and **future** Markdown / rich-text click handling."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Scheme:** `anima:` (no `//`). Example:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "anima:42?component=task_item&present=overlay\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Motivation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:20
msgid ""
"Recognize and open entities from **text** (Markdown, notices) later via "
"`openEntityResource`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:20
msgid "Share / deep-link / cross-module open today"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:20
msgid ""
"Structured FK in PG/Habitat remain **numeric ids** — Anima URI is not a "
"persistence format"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:22
msgid ""
"This task ships: grammar + `parse`/`format` + overlay registry + `task_item` "
"sample. **Not yet:** Chat Markdown link interception."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Grammar"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "anima:{id}[?component={component}][&present=navigate|overlay]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Part        | Meaning                                                                                                                                       |\n"
"| ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `id`        | `entities.id` (positive integer)                                                                                                              |\n"
"| `component` | Component tag used as the **view facet** (which overlay / module mapping). Optional; if omitted, open resolves **`primary_component`**        |\n"
"| `present`   | `navigate` = switch Shell module and select; `overlay` = open registered overlay. Defaults depend on component (e.g. `task_item` → `overlay`) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "**No short aliases** (e.g. `task` is invalid). Values must be full component names.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Do not use** `anima://…` as the normative form (id would be mis-parsed as URL host; `anima://42:task_item` is an invalid URL).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:40
msgid ""
"Same `id` with different `component=` can open **different** overlays "
"(entity may carry multiple `components[]`). Registry key is the component "
"tag, not the Shell module id."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Layering vs persistence"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer                   | Stores                                         | Anima URI                                                 |\n"
"| ----------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| PG / Habitat body / RPC | Entity **`id`** (e.g. pomodoro `task_item_id`) | **Never** as FK string                                    |\n"
"| Shell UI                | —                                              | `formatAnimaUri` / `parseAnimaUri` / `openEntityResource` |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:49
msgid ""
"Anima URI is a **Shell/UI locator protocol**, not a database foreign key. "
"User-authored body text that happens to contain `anima:…` is content, not a "
"structured relation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overlay registration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each displayable component may `registerEntityOverlay(component, OverlayComponent)`.  \n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "`present=overlay` → resolve component (default `primary_component`) → look up registry → `EntityOverlayHost`.  \n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/anima-uri.md:55
msgid ""
"`present=navigate` → map component → Shell path (e.g. `task_item` → `/tasks?"
"item=…`) via `navigateShellModulePath`."
msgstr ""

