"Assistant/user message bodies cite entities with `[[anima:{id}]]` or "
"`[[anima:{id}?component=semantic_memory]]`. Chat Markdown turns these into "
"clickable anchors that call `openEntityResource` (default overlay for "
"`semantic_memory`)."
msgstr ""
